# $52 IkutoGroundF: the second 16 x 8 level whose backdrop plane the
# level extractor put in the level's own .tmx (see esper_b1.route).
#
# Needs `make extract-levels` then `make manifest` with build 62's
# tools/extract_levels.py.

# IkutoB1's stairs up, 29,13.
start level $51 29 14
wait idle
walk up 2
wait idle
expect level $52 29 6
shot 01_ikuto_ground
walk down 2
wait idle
shot 02_two_down
expect no-stderr level:
